  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.24:\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude all build artifacts\n\nVersion 1.0.23: \n- Restored cache functionality in MediatRMediator Query method\n- Cache support for queries with automatic configuration discovery from handlers\n- Fixed test issues with command and event verification\n- All tests passing\n\nVersion 1.0.22: \n- Simplified MediatRMediator to remove retry and timeout features from query/command handling\n- Fixed test issues with command and event verification\n\nVersion 1.0.21: \n- Added ICqrsMediator interface and MediatRMediator implementation with caching support\n- Added QueryCacheConfiguration for query result caching\n- Added HandlerBehaviorConfiguration for handler behaviors (retry, timeout, performance tracking, logging)\n- Added protected configuration methods to QueryHandler, CommandHandler, and EventHandler base classes\n- Added automatic behavior discovery and application in MediatRMediator\n- Added comprehensive test suite for mediator functionality\n\nVersion 1.0.20: \n- Added InternalsVisibleTo attribute for test project access\n\nVersion 1.0.19: \n- Updated to support nested includes from Domain layer\n- Enhanced application layer compatibility with new IncludeChain functionality\n\nVersion 1.0.18: \n- Updated ModifiableAggregateDto to use ModifiedAt/ModifiedBy instead of LastModifiedAt/LastModifiedBy\n- Breaking change: ModifiableAggregateDto properties renamed from LastModifiedAt/LastModifiedBy to ModifiedAt/ModifiedBy",
